36948>>>>>>>Class cPasswordHasher is a cObject
36949>>>>>>>    
36949>>>>>>>    Import_Class_Protocol cPasswordHasher_Mixin
36950>>>>>>>    
36950>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
36952>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
36954>>>>>>>        
36954>>>>>>>        Property UInteger   peAlgorithm         C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_512 
36955>>>>>>>        Property UInteger   puiSaltSize         16
36956>>>>>>>        
36956>>>>>>>        Property UInteger   puiOptTimeCost      420000
36957>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36958>>>>>>>    
36958>>>>>>>    Function CreatePasswordHash String sPassword String ByRef sHash Returns Boolean
36960>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
36960>>>>>>>        UInteger uiAlgo
36960>>>>>>>        Get peAlgorithm to uiAlgo
36961>>>>>>>        
36961>>>>>>>        Case Begin
36961>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_256)
36963>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_512)
36966>>>>>>>                Get CreatePasswordHashEx uiAlgo (puiSaltSize(Self)) sPassword (&sHash) (puiOptTimeCost(Self)) to bOk
36967>>>>>>>                Case Break
36968>>>>>>>            Case Else
36968>>>>>>>                Error 8710 "Invalid algorithm selected."
36969>>>>>>>>
36969>>>>>>>                Function_Return False
36970>>>>>>>        Case End
36970>>>>>>>        
36970>>>>>>>        Function_Return bOk
