36972>>>>>>>    Function RequiredBufferSize Returns UBigInt
36974>>>>>>>        UBigInt ullSize
36974>>>>>>>        UInteger uiAlgo
36974>>>>>>>        Get peAlgorithm to uiAlgo
36975>>>>>>>        
36975>>>>>>>        Case Begin
36975>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_256)
36977>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_512)
36980>>>>>>>                Get RequiredBufferSizeEx uiAlgo (puiSaltSize(Self)) (puiOptTimeCost(Self)) to ullSize
36981>>>>>>>                Case Break
36982>>>>>>>            Case Else
36982>>>>>>>                Error 8710 "Invalid algorithm selected."
36983>>>>>>>>
36983>>>>>>>                Function_Return 0
36984>>>>>>>        Case End
36984>>>>>>>        
36984>>>>>>>        Function_Return ullSize
36985>>>>>>>    End_Function
